  <name>Frame Tweaks</name>
  <summary>Install, check and remove tweaks for the Steam Frame's desktop mode</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.astronautcheetah">
    <name>AstronautCheetah</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      A checklist installer of home-folder-only tweaks for the Valve Steam Frame: the keys the
      Steam keyboard lacks, local dictation, curved world windows, one clipboard and one KDE
      wallet for desktop mode and VR, menu icons for Steam's "+" menu, and optional app setups.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Everything installs into your home folder, so SteamOS updates don't undo it</li>
      <li>Every tweak installs, checks and removes on its own</li>
      <li>Upstream downloads are pinned to recorded checksums</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Not affiliated with or endorsed by Valve.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.AstronautCheetah.FrameTweaks.desktop</launchable>
